#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: As shown above, the circuit with $k$ time steps will have $4k$ two-qubit gate layers.\n"
msgstr "Tandaan: Tulad ng makikita sa itaas, ang circuit na may $k$ time steps ay magtataglay ng $4k$ na two-qubit gate layers.\n"

